{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:720","content":{"id":720,"title":"除自身以外数组的乘积","content":[{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给你一个整数数组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，返回 数组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"answer","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其中 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"answer[i]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中除 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums[i]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之外其余各元素的乘积 。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目数据保证数组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之中任意元素的全部前缀元素和后缀的乘积都在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"32","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 位 整数范围内。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"请不要使用除法，且在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"O(n)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(n)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时间复杂度内完成此题。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"detail","title":"示例 1:","open":true,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入: "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums = [1,2,3,4]","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出: "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[24,12,8,6]","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"detail","title":"示例 2:","open":true,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输入: "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums = [-1,1,0,-3,3]","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出: "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[0,0,9,0,0]","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":" 提示："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2 <= nums.length <= 10^5","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"-30 <= nums[i] <= 30","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"保证数组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之中任意元素的全部前缀元素和后缀的乘积都在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"32","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 位 整数范围内。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"进阶：你可以在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"O(1)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的额外空间复杂度内完成这个题目吗？（ 出于对空间复杂度分析的目的，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"输出数组 不被视为额外空间","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。）"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nums[i]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之外其余各元素的乘积等于它左边所有元素的乘积和右边所有元素的乘积，我们可以使用两个数组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"L","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"R","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 分别表示左边所有元素的乘积和右边所有元素的乘积，可以知道 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"L[0] = 1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因为第一个元素左边没有元素，同理 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"R[n - 1] = 1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"answer[i] = L[i] * R[i]","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"function productExceptSelf(nums: number[]): number[] {\n    const n = nums.length;\n    const L = Array.from({ length: n }).fill(1) as number[];\n    const R = Array.from({ length: n }).fill(1) as number[];\n    const answers = Array.from({ length: n }).fill(1) as number[];\n\n    for (let i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n        L[i] = L[i - 1] * nums[i - 1];\n    }\n\n    for (let j = n - 2; j >=0; j--) {\n        R[j] = R[j + 1] * nums[j + 1];\n    }\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        answers[i] = L[i] * R[i];\n    }\n\n    return answers;\n};","language":"ts","uuid":"816b173e-55eb-46cf-bd19-9ad648c508a0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里创建了两个辅助的数组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"L","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"R","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，空间复杂度为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"O(n)","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(n)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其实完全可以利用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"answers","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，先存储 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"L","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的内容，然后倒序乘上右边的值"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"function productExceptSelf(nums: number[]): number[] {\n    const n = nums.length;\n    const answers = Array.from({ length: n }).fill(1) as number[];\n\n    for (let i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n        answers[i] = answers[i - 1] * nums[i - 1];\n    }\n\n    let R = 1;\n    for (let j = n - 1; j >=0; j--) {\n        answers[j] = answers[j] * R;\n        R = R * nums[j];\n    }\n\n    return answers;\n};","language":"ts","uuid":"ab8fd00c-cc5b-437b-a930-c03acfe7af59","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"甚至再极致一点，可以在一个循环里面解决，同时进行左右的扫描"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"function productExceptSelf(nums: number[]): number[] {\n  \tconst n = nums.length;\n    const answers = Array.from({ length: n }).fill(1) as number[];\n  \n  \tlet L = 1;\n    let R = 1;\n    for (let i = 0, j = nums.length - 1; i < nums.length && j >=0; i++, j--) {\n        answers[i] = answers[i] * L;\n        answers[j] = answers[j] * R;\n        L = L * nums[i];\n        R = R * nums[j];\n    }\n\n    return answers;\n};","language":"ts","uuid":"8d4b5397-ecb1-4d86-8f1c-1d13a6b444e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}],"level":2},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode.cn/problems/product-of-array-except-self/description/?envType=study-plan-v2&envId=top-interview-150","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除自身以外数组的乘积"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"数组"},{"label":"除自身以外数组的乘积","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:720","type":"doc","id":720}}],"prevPage":{"title":"多数元素","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},"nextPage":{"title":"包含 min 函数的栈","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:674","type":"doc","id":674}},"createTime":1729164158046,"updateTime":1743303640582,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640582}}